1.4.9

## Version History

### v1.4.9 (2026-09-24)
**Required-answer feedback**

- Submitting or continuing with no answer shows a message and highlights the choices

### v1.4.8 (2026-09-23)
**Collapsed controls in the top-right**

- The angle and close button stay in the top-right corner of the closed bar

### v1.4.7 (2026-09-23)
**Full question text**

- Collapsed bar shows the whole question and wraps onto extra lines instead of truncating
- Each question is prefixed with "Question:"

### v1.4.6 (2026-09-23)
**Collapse angle direction**

- Closed state points the angle up; the old rotation was flipping it back down
- The angle button keeps its background instead of showing it only on hover

### v1.4.5 (2026-09-23)
**Tighter collapsed bar**

- Closed bar padding is 10px
- Collapse angle and close icon share the same size and center line

### v1.4.4 (2026-09-23)
**Collapsed bar on mobile**

- Question text wraps to two lines, with an ellipsis only when it still does not fit
- Collapse angle points up in the closed state and lines up with the close button

### v1.4.3 (2026-09-23)
**Collapse toggle is an angle**

- Minimize control next to the close button is a small up/down angle instead of plus and minus

### v1.4.2 (2026-09-23)
**Mobile collapse follows the viewport**

- Surveys collapse whenever the viewport is phone-sized, including after switching into a device preview
- Embed script cache reduced to 60 seconds

### v1.4.1 (2026-09-23)
**Collapsed survey on mobile**

- Surveys open as the question bar on screens narrower than 768px
- Visitors tap the question to expand and submit
- Desktop still opens fully expanded

### v1.4.0 (2026-09-02)
**External API**

- Added /api/v1 endpoints for sites, surveys, and responses
- API key authentication and an API Keys page in the admin

### v1.3.4 (2026-08-24)
**Custom Submit Button Text & Stats Edit Shortcut**

New Features:
- Appearance setting for submit button text
- Leave empty to keep the default label "Submit"
- Edit Survey button on the survey stats / responses screen

### v1.3.3 (2026-08-16)
**Custom Event Trigger**

New Features:
- Added "On a custom event" timing option alongside Immediate, Delay, Scroll, and Exit Intent
- Host pages can show a survey by calling `window.PFMSurveys.trigger('event_name')`
- Events fired before embed.js loads are queued and flushed once surveys are ready
- Page targeting, geo, frequency, and optional post-event delay still apply

### v1.3.2 (2026-08-11)
**Exit Intent Trigger**

New Features:
- Added "Exit Intent" timing option alongside Immediate, Delay, and Scroll
- Survey shows when the visitor moves their cursor toward the browser chrome to leave the page
- Desktop-focused (touch devices typically do not trigger exit intent)

### v1.3.1 (2026-08-04)
**Bulk Export from Surveys List**

New Features:
- Export button on Surveys list enters multi-select mode with checkboxes
- Export selected surveys as separate CSV response files
- Shared CSV export utility reused by single-survey and bulk export

### v1.3.0 (2026-07-09)
**Page Exclude Rules ("URL doesn't contain") Targeting**

New Features:
- Added "Exclude Pages" section to survey targeting: "URL doesn't contain" rules
- Exclude rules apply with AND logic (survey hidden if ANY exclude rule matches), independent of the existing OR-matched "Page Rules"
- Applies regardless of "All pages" / "Specific pages" selection

### v1.2.0 (2026-06-14)
**Checkboxes (Multiple Choice) Question Type**

New Features:
- Added Checkboxes (Multiple Choice) question type
- Multiple answer selection with single submit action
- Full support across survey editor, embed widget, and response analytics
- Aggregated display of multi-select answers in response viewer

### v1.1.1 (2026-06-11)
**Blurr Deployment & Branding**

- Deployed to surveys.blurr-marketing.cloud (new VPS)
- Blurr Surveys branding on login and dashboard
- Fixed missing timing_mode and scroll_percentage DB columns

### v0.1.0 (2026-02-04)
**Initial Release with Security Hardening**

Security Features:
- Domain validation with Origin/Referer checks
- Three-tier rate limiting (global, per-IP, per-site)
- Request body limits and Zod validation
- Input cleanup with safe output rendering
- Database length constraints
- Production HTTPS setup with Caddy

Core Features:
- Multi-tenant survey platform
- Multiple question types (radio, checkbox, text, rating)
- Display settings and targeting rules
- Event tracking (impressions, responses, dismissals)
- Geo-location detection
- Email invitations via SMTP (Hostinger)
- Real-time analytics and reporting
- Background job processing with BullMQ

Admin Features:
- Site management with domain security
- Survey builder with question editor
- Response analytics with charts
- Team management
- My Surveys / All Surveys filtering

Technical:
- FastifyAPI backend with TypeScript
- Vue.js admin frontend
- PostgreSQL database
- Redis for caching and queues
- Docker containerization
- Automated migrations
